title: "OntoRisk: Event-centric, Evidence-constrained AI Risk Knowledge Graph Construction"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-08"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Chuan-Zzz/AI_Risk_KG"
abstract: >-
  OntoRisk automatically constructs event-centric AI risk knowledge graphs
  from multi-document incident reports. The pipeline couples ontology-aligned
  explicit extraction with evidence-constrained controlled inference, and
  supports cross-event entity fusion into a global Neo4j graph.
keywords:
  - knowledge graph
  - AI risk
  - information extraction
  - ontology
  - LangGraph
type: software
